{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10379","headline":"同敬八卢五泛河间清河 · 高适","name":"同敬八卢五泛河间清河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清川在城下，沿泛多所宜。\n同济惬数公，翫物欣良时。\n飘颻波上兴，燕婉舟中词。\n昔陟乃平原，今来忽涟漪。\n东流达沧海，西流延滹池。\n云树共晦明，井邑相逶迤。\n稍随归月帆，若与沙鸥期。\n渔父更留我，前潭水未滋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10379.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10379","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}